---
const specialties = ['Infra / 研发效能', '智能驾驶', 'AI / 投资研究']
---

<section class="home-profile" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
  <p class="profile-kicker">CODER · BUILDER · INVESTOR</p>
  <h1 id="profile-title">在工程系统与产业变化之间，寻找长期价值。</h1>
  <p class="profile-intro">
    我是 Kairos，一名专注基础设施与工程效率的 Coder。长期实践于 Infra、研发效能与智能驾驶领域，参与 AI Infra
    基础底座建设，并持续研究技术演进背后的投资机会。
  </p>

  <ul class="specialty-list" aria-label="关注领域">
    {specialties.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <div class="proof-grid">
    <p><strong>研发效能</strong><span>建设覆盖数十个项目的整体工具链，关键组件将单任务耗时缩短 20 分钟以上</span></p>
    <p><strong>AI Infra</strong><span>参与基础底座建设，负责多云环境的维护、开发与稳定性保障</span></p>
    <p><strong>开源与 Skill</strong><span>贡献多个内部与外部开源项目，多项自研 Skill 在内部广泛使用</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="profile-actions">
    <a href="/about">了解更多关于我</a>
    <a href="/investing">阅读投资分析</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-profile {
    border-block: 2px solid currentColor;
    padding-block: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .profile-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--uno-fonts-ui);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .profile-intro {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .specialty-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    list-style: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .specialty-list li::before {
    content: '#';
    margin-right: 0.15rem;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-block: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 30%, transparent);
  }

  .proof-grid p {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .proof-grid p + p {
    border-left: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 30%, transparent);
  }

  .proof-grid strong {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .profile-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .proof-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .proof-grid p + p {
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 30%, transparent);
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
